[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":159},["ShallowReactive",2],{"l0R-xpyhIiywD5WWDsytsGAyENl93vbBSmwpYQB34A8":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":44,"sector":45,"services":52,"introCopy":53,"storyblockAccordions":54,"storyblockAssets":64,"flexibleContent":89,"footerLinkLabel":151,"footerLinks":152},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Vertu","Shed crafted a luxury retail experience driven by storytelling—boosting sales 160% in Singapore and expanding from 2 to 250 stores worldwide in 5 years.",null,"vertu",true,{"hex":11},"#191919",{"hex":13},"#A7A7A7","Bringing retail stories to life. Delivering the ultimate in luxury tech across 38 countries.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Vertu\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":30,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":34},false,900,"",1600,{"width":33,"height":35,"url":36,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":37},898,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":38,"srcSet":39,"src":40,"width":41,"height":42,"sizes":43},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1736937818-shed_v_14.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,1796,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Global Roll Out",[46,49],{"slug":47,"label":48},"retail","Retail",{"slug":50,"label":51},"exhibition","Exhibition","Interior Design, Wholesale, POS, Event Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>We built a luxury store experience around product interaction and storytelling. Sales rose instantly by 160% with the opening of our first concept store in Singapore. The number of stores worldwide rose exponentially from 2 to 250 in 5 years.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[55,58,61],{"title":56,"copy":57},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>There was a moment in early 2000s when Vertu arrived on the world&rsquo;s luxury scene and unashamedly sold mobile cell phones to the well-healed for tens, sometimes, hundreds of thousands of dollars. But remember, Vertu wasn&rsquo;t a mobile phone maker per se, that was the trick, it was the ultimate status symbol of its time. They were players and they wanted to grow fast&hellip;worldwide. Vertu was looking for an interior design studio, Shed was to take them there.\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":59,"copy":60},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The strategy was to unlock how customers interacted and emotionally connected with the product. We approached the store like exhibitions, telling product stories to increase brand engagement, often with very little product on display.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":62,"copy":63},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1NDg5NDQ1MTgsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>This was genuine high quality, fast-paced retail roll out which delivered in over 38 countries. \u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>New store concept design\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Wholesale POS concept design\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Global rollout 250 stores in 45 countries\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Events and launches\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Office and all interior branded environments\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Sale conversion rate in-store increased threefold and the overall brand awareness transformed from fledgling retailer to a major luxury retail presence in every major world city.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Credits: Video content by Vertu.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[65,77,87],{"isVideo":30,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":66},{"width":67,"height":68,"url":69,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":70},1047,589,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":71,"srcSet":72,"src":73,"width":74,"height":75,"sizes":76},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147098-shed_v_03.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094",2094,1178,"(max-width: 2094px) 100vw, 2094px",{"isVideo":30,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":78},{"width":79,"height":80,"url":81,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":82},518,342,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1738147121-shed_v_12.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":83,"srcSet":84,"src":85,"width":74,"height":86,"sizes":76},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133